---
config:
  theme: base
  themeVariables:
    background: "#f4f9fc"
    fontFamily: "-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, PingFang SC, sans-serif"
    primaryColor: "#f7fbfd"
    primaryTextColor: "#172229"
    primaryBorderColor: "#7ea1b4"
    lineColor: "#5d7990"
    clusterBkg: "#edf6fb"
    clusterBorder: "#7fafcf"
  flowchart:
    curve: basis
    htmlLabels: true
---
flowchart LR
  accTitle: Target 资格、调度与可靠性
  accDescr: 当前 Profile 中同一逻辑模型的 Target 先经硬约束和运行时资格过滤，再形成有序计划；预留或提交前失败只能在预算内前进到计划中的下一 Target。

  subgraph PROFILE["当前 Profile · 同一逻辑模型"]
    direction LR
    TARGETS["Target candidates<br/>ModelCard ∩ Target"]
    HARD["硬约束<br/>能力 · 隐私 · 地域 · 价格"]
    STATE["ProfileRuntime 资格快照<br/>health · circuit · credential<br/>cooldown · capacity"]
    ELIGIBLE["Eligible Targets"]
    SCHEDULER["有界 Scheduler"]
    PLAN["有序 PlannedAttempt[]"]
    RESERVE["AdmissionController.reserve()"]
    RESERVED{"预留成功？"}
    DISPATCH["dispatch"]
    RECOVERABLE{"ClientCommit 前<br/>可恢复失败？"}
    ADVANCE["消费 deadline / switch 预算<br/>下一计划内 Target"]
    OUTCOME["成功 · 入口协议失败<br/>或 ClientCommit 后终止"]

    TARGETS --> HARD --> ELIGIBLE
    STATE --> ELIGIBLE
    ELIGIBLE --> SCHEDULER --> PLAN --> RESERVE --> RESERVED
    RESERVED -->|"是"| DISPATCH --> RECOVERABLE
    RESERVED -->|"否"| ADVANCE
    RECOVERABLE -->|"是"| ADVANCE
    RECOVERABLE -->|"否"| OUTCOME
    ADVANCE -->|"预算仍允许"| RESERVE
    ADVANCE -->|"预算耗尽"| OUTCOME
  end

  classDef primary fill:#f7fbfd,color:#172229,stroke:#526f7e,stroke-width:1.5px;
  classDef filter fill:#e8f2ff,color:#172229,stroke:#3f75a3,stroke-width:1.5px;
  classDef runtime fill:#e7f7f6,color:#172229,stroke:#2d7774,stroke-width:1.5px;
  classDef decision fill:#fff4e7,color:#172229,stroke:#965b15,stroke-width:1.5px;
  classDef terminal fill:#eef0ff,color:#172229,stroke:#625eb5,stroke-width:1.5px;
  class TARGETS,PLAN primary;
  class HARD,ELIGIBLE,SCHEDULER filter;
  class STATE,RESERVE,DISPATCH runtime;
  class RESERVED,RECOVERABLE,ADVANCE decision;
  class OUTCOME terminal;
  style PROFILE fill:#edf6fb,stroke:#4a758f,stroke-width:2px,color:#172229
